This seems like a sensible idea. Monsters shouldn't be an endless
supply. Maybe a few molds should grow or something but not whole
tribes of orcs etc. Maybe after a level is cleared completely humanoid
creatures (elves, dwarves, hobbits) etc. should start moving in and
start to inhabit it and turn it in to a small village. Could be
interesting? Feel free to argue with me. Most people do.

